    <string name="help_title_general_description">General Description</string>
    <string name="help_group_general_desc"><![CDATA[<b>What is a group</b><br/><br/>
        A Group is your team with whom you want to create and manage funds.
        You can create and manage multiple groups. Each group needs to have a moderator.
        On the Home screen you can click on the Group dropdown to change the group if you have multiple groups.
         On the Home screen click on the + Add Group icon to add Group<br/>
        <b>Actions:</b><br/>
        • Add members to your group<br/>
        • Create and manage funds together<br/>
        • Track deposits and loans<br/>
        • Assign moderators for management<br/><br/>
    ]]></string>
    <string name="help_fund_general_desc"><![CDATA[<b>What is a fund</b><br/><br/>
        A Fund is the monthly contribution of funds which you can create among the group members.
        You can create and manage multiple funds in a group. Only a moderator can create funds.
        On the Funds screen you can click + icon to add Funds.<br/>
        <b>Actions:</b><br/>
        • Add members to your fund<br/>
        • Create and manage funds together<br/>
        • Track deposits and loans<br/>
        • Assign moderators for management<br/><br/>
    ]]></string>
    <string name="help_loan_emi_add_desc"> <![CDATA[<b>How to add a loan emi</b><br/><br/>

        <b>Steps:</b><br/>
        • Select fund<br/>
        • Choose month and year<br/>
        • Enter amount and save<br/><br/>

        <b>Tip:</b><br/>
        Ensure the correct fund is selected.<br/><br/>

        ]]></string>
